      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Bas\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/a587f6/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Bas:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Question regarding 2b, \"the replacing of a power card\": Is that only when there are 2 power cards in play and one is exchanged, or does BB also gain a token when he plays power cards after he has been incapacitated (and has to re-place his power cards one by one over two turns)?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It is when he removes one of his Power cards and places another one.</p>",
